mod:fall_carries_its_road;
// A `fall` CARRIES ITS ROAD INTO THE ARM IT NAMES (DEF-437 with DEF-536, HIGH, pre-existing, landing 177d2b). `fall label;` enters a
// later arm's BODY, past that arm's pattern, its `is_error` refinement and its guard, and the move walk read each arm from the state
// before the pick: what the falling arm moved, freed, sealed, rewrote or wrote once was live, checked, writable and unwritten in the
// target, and what the target's own test or guard grants was granted on a road that never ran them. One module per cell, each
// accepted before this landing and each wrong when run (60: `.value` of an error; 72: a `fixed` with two values; 74: a second free;
// 97: a sealed page written, or an unsealed one called; 98: a moved or unassigned string read).
//   The eight facts, each on a `fall` road: `moved` (`m*`, `y4*`, `t8`, `o_*`, `a8`, `mf4`, `np2`, `np3`, `ls3`), `freed`
//   (`e_freed_twice`), `sealed_any` (`e_sealed_any_write`), `may` (`e_may_fixed_twice`), and the four that permit, which a road
//   that didn't earn them drops: `must` (`b2`, `b7`, `b9`, `mf1`, `mf2`, `dc1`), `checked` (`b1`, `b4`, `b5`, `b6`, `b8`, `f1`,
//   `f2`, `lp1`, `lp2`, `df1`, `df2`), `errchecked` (`b3`), `sealed_firm` (`e_sealed_firm_call`, `m1_sl_fallg_LT`).
//   The roads: a `fall` out of an `if`, a loop's later trip (`lp1`, `lp2`, `m2`), a block whose `defer` it runs (`m3`, `m3b`,
//   `df1`, `df2`), a value `pick` (`a8`, `b5`, `m4`), a macro's body (`ls3`), a chain of three (`m1`, `mf4`), two `fall`s into
//   one arm with the grant on one (`mf1`, `mf2`), an inner pick before and inside (`m5`, `m6`, `np2`, `np3`), and code after the
//   `fall` that never runs (`dc1`: the road is the state AT the `fall`).
//   Controls that run right and are refused for the road their text has: `b1c`, `b2c`, `b3c`, `b7c` (the data doesn't take the
//   `fall`), `y4e` (a second move of a vacant string).
//   THE PRICE, right on every road and refused: ONE ROAD FOR THE PICK, so a labelled arm takes every `fall` before it whichever
//   label it names (`p3_two_targets_ok`, `dl1_dup_label_second_reads`). Gone with landing 177d2b2 and in the program beside this
//   file: a `fall` runs the `defer`s of the blocks it leaves on its own road, at the `fall`, so a body in another arm
//   (`p4_defer_in_other_arm_ok`) and a body registered after the `fall` left (`pr1_defer_after_fall_ok`) aren't on it. The same
//   shape inside an inner pick was accepted before (`np5c`, there too).
mod:a8_fall_in_pick_expr = {
error:E5_a8_fall_in_pick_expr;
func:mk = string() never fails { pass string_concat("ab", "cde"); }; func:fs = int64(string:v, int64:k) never fails { pass (string_bytes(v)[0i64] => int64) - 90i64 + k; }; func:eat = int64(move string:v) never fails { pass 0i64; };
func:f = int64() never fails { string:s = raw mk(); int64:k = 1i64; int64:t = pick (k) { (1i64) { discard(raw eat(move(s))); fall two; }, two: (2i64) { give raw fs(s, 0i64); }, (*) { give 5i64; } }; pass t; };
};
